<title>GERMANY: Bunds, futures close down after turbulent session.</title>
<headline>Bunds, futures close down after turbulent session.</headline>
<text>
<p>1600 GMT - Bunds and futures end choppy day significantly weaker as domestic EMU and budget troubles undermine confidence.</p>
<p>Market seen remaining cautious on Friday.</p>
<p>* 6.00% Jan 2007 Bund 102.20, yld 5.70 pct (102.44)</p>
<p>* June Bund future 102.36 (102.56), day's range 102.10-102.51</p>
